        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`. Completion with `method='cmdline'` now respects 'ignorecase' and 'smartcase'. I.e. in order for `myus` to be recognized as a base, there needs to be `'ignorecase'` set. This is how built-in command line completion acts.",
